        },
        {
          "text": "“You are the people of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God. So when you mourn for the dead, don't gash yourselves or shave the front of your head, as other people do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
